OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 72, to crawl across counties
OL,4,Aafter World Cup bet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 72-year-old man is preparing to crawl
OL,7,Facross two counties after betting with
OL,8,Ffriends that England would win the
OL,9,FWorld Cup earlier this year.
OL,11,FBarry Illing, 72, will set off from
OL,12,FDown Ampney in Gloucestershire before
OL,13,Fcrawling three miles (4.8km) to
OL,14,FCricklade in Wiltshire on 7 November to
OL,15,Fraise money for Prospect Hospice in
OL,16,FWroughton.
OL,18,FHe is taking on the feat after
OL,19,Fpromising his friends he would crawl
OL,20,Fone mile (1.6km) if the England team
OL,21,Fwon the tournament, two miles (3.2km)
OL,22,Ffor second place and three for third.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
