OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 72, to crawl across counties
OL,4,Aafter World Cup bet
OL,5,
OL,6,FIlling, from Gloucestershire, said: "I
OL,7,Fwas banking on them getting gold. It
OL,8,F[crawling] does put pressure on [your]
OL,9,Fwrists, shoulders and neck."
